{"id":"steam-1416510","steam":1416510,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Production City","summary":"Production City is a city builder focused on manufacturing, logistics, and politics. Build efficient production chains, make impactful (or questionable) decisions, and grow your city into an industrial empire!","about":"Story Background\n\nYour grandfather had a big dream: He wanted to become rich. However, he died during the process. Luckily, he already purchased an island and connected it with a tunnel.\n\nNow it's your turn! Transform this empty island into a thriving industrial city! You don't care about  boring city services, you just need workers and factories.\n\n \n\nBuild Efficient Production Chains\n\nManage an industrial city, build efficient production chains and grow your city into an industrial empire! You can also build inefficient production chains, I'm not your boss.\n\nMake Impactful Decisions\n\nUse policies and laws to define your city’s future! Make the right decisions and become Mayor of the Month.\n\nIf you make questionable decisions, you need to... convince others that they are great. Just smile and wave. After all, you're the only mayor, so who's going to stop you?\n\nLook at that beautiful sunset, complemented by the even more beautiful factory smoke! But don't stare at it for too long — you have a city to run!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416510/99b42becbe8f6a63a6b27a9fc62a694b8ae0f115/library_capsule.jpg?t=1788255008","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416510/6efdfcf16c1f4e0a7c8ebfde117a853bb2515122/header.jpg?t=1788255008","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416510/4ab3649cd9c81f074de3a133c8ad892d83daa194/library_hero.jpg?t=1788255008","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416510/6efdfcf16c1f4e0a7c8ebfde117a853bb2515122/header.jpg?t=1788255008","background":nu